                            "The sound made whilst blowing a raspberry."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f7b12a5-3e6a-374e-9aba-51ef95a26dd4",
                        "entry_id": "a1fef006-aa83-35e7-8fce-3bb7b3e5fb5d",
